~ ChrisDayThree
set Player.canMove = false
set NPC.tempElapTime = NPC.elapsedTime
set NPC.tempCycProg = NPC.cycleProgress

Though I approached him, it was almost as if Chris had sought me out.
Chris: "Mr. Mort! Do you want me to come over to get those ingredients now?"
- Kill Him [if IM.inventory[8]]
	Everything was in place. Agatha was bound to notice soon, so I had to act quickly.
	Mort: "Of course, Chris! Head on over whenever you can and I'll be right over."
	Mort: "Make yourself at home while you're waiting, I won't be long! Do mind the stains on the carpet though, I spilled some cranberry juice and it won't come out."
	Chris seemed puzzled when I said this. ####. I didn't mess up, did I?
	Chris: "Dang, Mr. Mort. I always pictured you as the careful and meticulous type."
	I chuckled as I felt more relief in that moment than ever before in my life. I was so close, I couldn't blow it now.
	Mort: "Chris you really know how to inflate a guy's ego. I can be like that when I want to be, but I'm still human."
	Mort: "Now head on over, I'll be back at the house in just a second."

	set NPC.canBeKilled = true
	set NPC.elapsedTime = 0
	set NPC.cycleProgress = 0
