	Chris nodded as he sped along towards my house. It was hard to keep an eye on him.
	
- Don't Kill Him
	Not everything was ready yet. I couldn't let Chris go over before I was done, or else I wouldn't get another chance. 
	After I was done with him, everything I needed to do was inside the house. It would be better to have everything handled before then.
	Mort: "Not just yet, Chris. I still have a few errands I need to run, but I'll cicle back to you when I'm free, okay?"
	Chris nodded, clearly impatient, but too polite to raise any objections as I slinked away.
	
	set NPC.conversationsHad -= 1

	set NPC.elapsedTime = NPC.tempElapTime
	set NPC.cycleProgress = NPC.tempCycProg
