if (IM.inventory[8] && IM.inventory[9] && IM.inventory[10]):
	I've gathered all the items I need for today's recipe.
	If I'm being honest, I know that Chris didn't deserve this.
	He's the least responsible for what happened that day, but at this point, I can't leave anyone in the village alive.
	Tomorrow, though, that's another story.
	Agatha's going to pay for letting Harry die...
	
	set IM.dayCounter = 4
